    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="1.4">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IEw">I Ew</ref> 1.4</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif he ðonne ne mehte, ðonne namede him man VI men on ðam ylcan [geburscipe], þe he on hamfæst wære, ⁊ begete þara syxa ænne æt anum hryðere, oððe æt þam orfe þe ðæs weorð sy; ⁊ syððan wexe be ðæs ceapes æhte, gif þær ma to scyle.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If, however, he cannot do so, then six men from the same locality in which he is resident shall be nominated to him, and he shall choose one of these six for each cow or for livestock of equivalent value. Afterwards, if more witnesses are necessary, the number shall be increased in proportion to the value of the property [in dispute].</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gyf he ðone ne mæhte, ðone namede him man VI men on ðam ylcan geburscipe, ðe he on hamfæst wære, ⁊ begete ðara syxa ænne æt anum hryðere, oððe æt ðam orfe ðe ðæs weorð sy; ⁊ syððan wexe be ðæs ceapes eahte, gif ðær ma to scyle.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
